Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.15,0:00:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back where we left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.81,0:01:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all we have to do\Nis follow those tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If all goes well, they should lead\Nus straight to Tristan and Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,assuming they haven't wandered off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They better be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do what we set out to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure out where this\Ndarts creep hangs out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can set free everyone he captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.90,0:01:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wish it were that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been lugging this geek\Nfor like two hours already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Try four minutes, but since\NI'm nice, I'll play you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you're doing\Nit, but you're cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the fifth time in a row you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just delirious, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won by playing scissors every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I can't move another inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.85,0:02:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I promise to buy you a pepperoni\Npizza when we reach civilization?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, pepperoni?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we got places to go. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I said what if I get you a pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play rock, paper, scissors for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.03,0:02:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave Joey Wheeler to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do nothing until Master\NDarts gives you an assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, third grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I decide who I'm gonna duel for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wait for the homework assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show a little respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Roth, as if Little\NMiss Loudmouth knows respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you call me? Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I was doing perfectly fine until\NJohnny Stuntman over there stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:03:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you, I would have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you, I don't need some scrawny\Nfreak dictating my every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here, losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let her go, Valon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She can try to run away from fate, but\Nin the end, she'll get what she deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to finish what I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone wants\Nto ride with the big boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice bike, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you took\Nthe training wheels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go back to the playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, move it or lose it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that was a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your only warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to beat us\Nup with a hologram, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say I didn't warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. More company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And he wants to play hardball. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see who's got more guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to stay\Nout of my way, tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here so I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done enough already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me, and I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take Wheeler down as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I duel alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last thing I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember the day we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.01,0:05:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were at the end of your rope Tired of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,living in the shadow of\Nyour so-called friends
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I stepped in\Nand took away the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that again, Mai I can help\Nyou get what you've always wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and what's that? Power? No,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.41,0:06:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you've already got that\NYou want revenge And the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,satisfaction of knowing\NWheeler got what he deserved
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me First we'll beat him, then\Nwe'll take on the rest of the world, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you take a hint?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that deep down you feel\Nthe same way I do, Mai. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lonely and misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.11,0:06:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We need each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.07,0:06:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My Valentine works alone, and\Nthat is never going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But my, I'm telling you, this can work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we have left so soon? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.05,0:06:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to catch up with the others now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Gramps can get just\Nas much rest on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, we can't translate those\Nancient ruins without his help, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of those biker\Npunks that brainwashed mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He works for darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car, Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with a lunatic here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, tell me what you did with Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys had no right to take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid, never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe this will refresh your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I win, you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.53,0:08:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dueled tougher opponents than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have a deal or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your big chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show me your stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.49,0:08:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She could use a lesson in manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got five minutes to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I can show off a few\Nof my new dueling strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You took me into it, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're dueling her, then\Nyou're dueling me too, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take both of you blokes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.59,0:08:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, don't let him play\Nthe Seal of Orycalcos. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:08:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna wipe the floor with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, then you're gonna tell us\Nwhere you sickos are keeping Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start things off with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Psychic Armahead in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's got no attack points. I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.53,0:09:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,trust this guy yeah he\Nmust be up to something
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,i bet he wants us to attack but he's in for\Na disappointment that's all for now kids
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,let the fun begin now i activate\Nthis my summon dice magic card
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But before I can use it I have\Nto give up 1,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If I roll a 1 or a 2, I can\Nsummon two monsters in one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I roll a 3 or a 4, I can summon\Na monster from my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really want a 5 or a 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can summon a powerful monster\Nwithout sacrificing something first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Orgoth the Relentless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn to kick a little butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with Luster Dragon\Nnumber two in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,His move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to our monsters, we\Nshould be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I activate my Psychic\NArmor Head's special effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you're wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it allows me to choose any armor monster I\Nwant from my deck and move it to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:11:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I sacrifice my Psychic Armor\NHead to summon Double Cloth Armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card face\Ndown and call it quits for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this guy thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He summoned another monster\Nwith zero attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I already know I'm going to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't I help you two out a bit by\Ntelling you what my new friend can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're dumb enough to\Nattack my double cloth armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,your monster will automatically\Nbe destroyed right on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then half your monster's attack points\Nare subtracted from your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That means if I attack his double cloth\Narmor with my Orgoth the Relentless,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lose 1250 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But after that, he'll have nothing\Non the field to protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip, big shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.49,0:12:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I place this face down for this to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need Rebecca's help
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Orgoth, attack Double\NCloth Armor with Diamond Blade Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I sacrifice Luster Dragon number\Ntwo to summon the original Luster Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Buster Dragon, attack\Nhis life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to burst your bubble,\Nbut I was expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So go magnet armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This little number allows\Nme to summon any armor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:12:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,monster I want from my\Ngraveyard back to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My double cloth armor returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, and I've got one trap card left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rope of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll activate it by\Ndiscarding my entire hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can use my rope\Nto pull Luster Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,out of the graveyard\Nand back to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time it returns\Nwith 800 extra attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Beck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.59,0:13:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Sword Revival!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:14:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever a dragon monster is revived\Nfrom the graveyard, this card kicks in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me sacrifice that dragon and\Nsummon another dragon in its place!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And the new dragon\Nbecomes Rebecca's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.89,0:14:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Diamond Head Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My Diamond Head Dragon absorbs all\Nof Luster Dragon's attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, it gets an extra 1,000\Nattack points on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Duke. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,One more turn and you're done, creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd let you win that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you, mate,\Nbut I'm just getting warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to change all the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to use a card that's\Npower is unmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A card unlike any other in\Nthe game of Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This move is sure to impress mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done, she'll be\Nbegging to run away with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.35,0:15:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to activate the\Nseal of Orichalcos, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You two numbskulls are hardly\Nworth the seal of Aurichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got something much more\Nfitting in store for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Armoured gravitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.19,0:16:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He merged with the card. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't stand up to our monster. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me fill you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When I attack you, I win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my armor's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, it destroys every\Nmonster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And the damage comes\Nout of our life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.99,0:16:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, won't\Nyou lose the duel, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheerio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, because you just\Nactivated my Miraforce trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That card's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been fun, mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:17:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But all good things must come to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, that was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a message for Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell that punk he's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.39,0:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,remind me why we're\Ncarrying this pipsqueak
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,who we don't even like all over creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And because we're nice guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And last I checked, it's\Nyour turn to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thea, do you see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, all those weird lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear it's the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened when\Nit emerged the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep feeding, my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.63,0:19:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's true, Sato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, could Yugi really have lost to\None of Alistair's partners in a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And does that mean he's\Ntrapped somewhere now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It just means Yugi's not as\Nperfect as everyone thinks he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.59,0:19:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got more important things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come here, Seto,\Nyou gotta check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it looks cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think's going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.39,0:19:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea, but I don't trust it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, we may be experiencing\Nsome mild turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please fasten your seatbelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.57,0:19:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
